// `std.session`: the home of the native session formers. `Run(S)` is the
// value type of the complete recorded runs of the session code `S`,
// `Prefix(S)` that of its recorded prefixes, and `Dialogue(S)` that of the
// complete dialogues over it. A source names each by listing it, `import
// std.session (Run, Prefix, Dialogue);` (#4521). The formers are native, so
// no declaration here states them: the lowering answers each in a source
// that lists it from this module, and nowhere else.
